{"sections":[{"slug":"几何量子化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何量子化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何量子化</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何量子化"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/quantization.html\" title=\"John Baez 的介绍 [https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/quantization.html]\">John Baez <span lang=\"zh\">的介绍</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/辛流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">辛流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(M,\\omega)$ <span lang=\"zh\">开始</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">先作预量子化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即选取</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hermite线丛","text":"Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $L$, <span lang=\"zh\">带有</span> $U(1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\nabla$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得其曲率等于</span> $i\\omega$. <span lang=\"zh\">这要求</span> $\\omega / 2\\pi$ <span lang=\"zh\">属于整数上同调类</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}